ient proportions, cost, nutrition values, tradeoff, and Candidate status.\",\n  \"when\": \"The client calls POST /api/v1/rations/optimization.\"\n },\n {\n  \"req\": \"REQ-2\",\n  \"given\": \"An authenticated client explicitly accepts an existing optimization candidate.\",\n  \"id\": \"AC-2.6\",\n  \"level\": \"api\",\n  \"then\": \"Each response status is 200 and each response contains the requested candidateId and its Saved or Assigned status.\",\n  \"when\": \"The client calls POST /api/v1/rations/candidates/{candidateId}/save and POST /api/v1/rations/candidates/{candidateId}/assign.\"\n },\n {\n  \"req\": \"REQ-2\",\n  \"given\": \"An authenticated client submits an invalid receipt.\",\n  \"id\": \"AC-2.7\",\n  \"level\": \"api\",\n  \"then\": \"The response status is 422 and the response contains the contract's error, code, and field validation information.\",\n  \"when\": \"The client calls POST /api/v1/inventory/receipts.\"\n },\n {\n  \"req\": \"REQ-3\",\n  \"given\": \"An authenticated client and dated plans for a pen containing animals from two lots exist.\",\n  \"id\": \"AC-3.1\",\n  \"level\": \"api\",\n  \"then\": \"The GET response status is 200 and its list includes delivery date, pen, ration, planned quantity, status, and lotAllocations; the POST response status is 201 and its returned plan contains planned quantity and a separate allocation for each lot whose quantities sum to the planned quantity.\",\n  \"when\": \"The client requests GET /api/v1/feeding-plans and submits a valid plan to POST /api/v1/feeding-plans.\"\n },\n {\n  \"req\": \"REQ-3\",\n  \"given\": \"An authenticated client and saved feeding activities exist.\",\n  \"id\": \"AC-3.2\",\n  \"level\": \"api\",\n  \"then\": \"The response status is 200 and the response list includes plannedQuantityLb, actualQuantityLb, varianceLb, inventoryConsumption, feedCostUsd, energyMcal, and lotAllocations.\",\n  \"when\": \"The client requests GET /api/v1/feeding-activities.\"\n },\n {\n  \"req\"